o=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8be08f00fb11b907fc52bdbc0196e5bc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67c01a9b/uploads/origins/be4d5d35-7789-4a83-b11d-48bf3ec95e13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8be08f00fb11b907fc52bdbc0196e5bc, https://si.imgix.net/67c01a9b/uploads/origins/be4d5d35-7789-4a83-b11d-48bf3ec95e13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=16110baa1ef2a0663f8b752d9c203a1b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67c01a9b/uploads/origins/be4d5d35-7789-4a83-b11d-48bf3ec95e13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9695548f7f3e12d23afb7ef198914f67 3x"}, "body": "(Please excuse the resending of this message due to an alteration in the requested text.)\nGood evening, Dr. Shigu. I always look at your wonderful illustrations. Your illustrations for the Winter Comic Book were wonderful...Thank you very much for your help ().\n\nI would like to ask for an illustration of Nico of the Blue Archive who has food poisoning and is excreting soft stool in a Japanese-style toilet. I would also like to ask for a depiction of vomiting.  (https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/131022217) I would like you to depict him as if he is vigorously excreting solid stool or soft stool like in this illustration of Aoba. Also, I would like you to make him OB around the toilet bowl with flamboyance and make the toilet bowl look messy.\n\nThe illustration of Kanoe in the food poisoning book of this winter's Comiket really stuck in my mind, so I would like to have the same angle of view and pose. Please depict a transparent depiction in the toilet bowl so that we can see what has accumulated in the toilet bowl as well as in that illustration.\n\nAlso, if possible\n (1) The figure of a person who is taking out a solid stool.\n2) Soft stools are being discharged vigorously after the solid stools have been discharged.\n(3) The figure vomi